      "message": "Thank you for the patch!\n\nI recognise that there is an issue in the code, but I don\u0027t think your change will address the root cause, which is that file descriptors greater than FD_SETSIZE are not supported by the select() method.\n\nI suggest switching to use the poll() method instead: https://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man2/poll.2.html, which does not have this limitation.\n\nWhat do you think?",
